Package: com.nextsolution.nextledger.smsdaemon
Name: Next Ledger SMS Daemon
Version: 2.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0)
Description: RootHide launch daemon that detects only new approved bank SMS and creates review drafts in Next Ledger. Transactions are recorded only after one-by-one approval.
Maintainer: Next Solution
Author: Zeeshan Barvi
Section: Utilities
Priority: optional
